WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.334
-Can you see me by the way?

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:04.437
Uh, yeah.
-Okay, good.

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:06.005
'Cause I just was wondering,
'cause I under--

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:08.540
Didn't you just
get Lasik surgery?

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:10.343
-I did.
How do you know that?

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:11.577
[ Laughter ]

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:14.514
-You got Lasik surgery,
which is a major surgery.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:16.683
-It i--
Yeah, but, um...

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:18.017
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:19.485
I did, but I don't --
I don't even tell people that.

00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:20.920
-But you can see me perfect?
I just want to make sure, yeah.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.322
-No, it was great.
I really can see very well.

00:00:23.322 --> 00:00:27.227
-Do you take painkillers or
anything when you do that stuff?

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:29.228
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.228 --> 00:00:32.031
Well, I mean, do they give you
like laughing gas or something?

00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:35.134
-They definitely give you
some pretty hard-core pills

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:37.436
after you...
-Yeah.

00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:40.240
-...have a laser in your eye.
What is going on?

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:42.641
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.641 --> 00:00:44.176
-So you're saying --
So, post-surgery,

00:00:44.176 --> 00:00:46.279
you're a little loopy?
You know?

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:48.915
You have things on your eyes?
And --

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:50.216
-What's happening right now?

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:51.684
[ Laughter ]
[ Drumroll ]

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:54.353
-Your mom may or may not have
videotaped you after surgery.

00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:57.323
[ Audience "Oohs," applause ]

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:58.758
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:00.292
And she gave us the video.

00:01:00.292 --> 00:01:02.061
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:04.864
-For the television?

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:06.699
-Wait.
This is a world premiere.

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:07.867
You got to check this out.

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:09.069
[ Drumroll ]
[ Cheers ]

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:12.505
This is Taylor Swift,
post-surgery.

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:14.307
You were, like,
freaking out over a banana.

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:15.608
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:18.344
Anyway, here's Taylor at home
after her Lasik surgery.

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:19.845
Video taken by her mom.
Take a look at this.

00:01:19.845 --> 00:01:21.014
This is real.

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:24.551
-Okay, so, she found --
she found a snack.

00:01:27.486 --> 00:01:29.255
-That wasn't the one I wanted.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:31.323
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.323 --> 00:01:33.159
-Stop, you can't cry.

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:35.928
That's not supposed to be
what you're doing.

00:01:35.928 --> 00:01:37.029
-I tried to get this one.

00:01:37.029 --> 00:01:38.865
-Okay, I'm gonna
get the other one for you.

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:40.133
Okay.

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.235
-I wanted this one,
but what do we do with this now?

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:43.569
-I'll eat it.
I'll eat it.

00:01:43.569 --> 00:01:45.771
It's mine.
-But it doesn't have a head.

00:01:45.771 --> 00:01:47.873
-Honey, it's fine.
I don't need a head.

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:49.475
-Okay. I'm crying.
I'm fine.

00:01:49.475 --> 00:01:50.876
-Don't --
You don't want to cry.

00:01:50.876 --> 00:01:53.079
That's not what you want to do.

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:57.350
-Sometimes it doesn't
go your way.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:02:00.753
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:02.589
-Don't fall asleep
eating a banana, okay?

00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:03.689
-I'm not asleep.

00:02:03.689 --> 00:02:05.925
My mind is alive.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:07.093
-Okay.

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:08.895
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:11.597
♪♪

00:02:11.597 --> 00:02:13.332
-Don't be mad.
Don't be mad.

00:02:13.332 --> 00:02:16.269
Don't be mad at me.
Don't be mad at me.

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:17.503
I made some calls.

00:02:17.503 --> 00:02:19.539
-Oh, my God!
-I may have made some calls.

00:02:19.539 --> 00:02:21.174
-That's on television.
-Me and your mom --

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:22.642
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:24.277
You goes,
"This one doesn't have a head.

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:26.178
What are we gonna do with it?"
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.178 --> 00:02:27.713
Me and your mom stayed in touch.
-Wait.

00:02:27.713 --> 00:02:29.582
She was kind enough
to drive me there

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:32.351
but cruel enough to film it
and give it to you?

00:02:32.351 --> 00:02:34.019
[ Laughter ]
-Yes, that's what --

00:02:34.019 --> 00:02:36.088
That's what a good mom does.
-Ugh!

00:02:36.088 --> 00:02:37.857
-I love you, Mom!

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:39.092
That's what a good mom does.

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:40.660
-I was --
You notice the --

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:44.330
I had these goggles on,
which are really high fashion.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:47.466
But then they had
to tape it to my head.

00:02:47.466 --> 00:02:49.101
-Yeah, and you're
not allowed to cry.

00:02:49.101 --> 00:02:50.937
And just -- Oh.
The whole thing was so funny.

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:53.272
-But I was crying, I think,
over a banana.

00:02:53.272 --> 00:02:54.474
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:55.874
-Oh, my gosh.
-Oh, my God.

00:02:55.874 --> 00:02:57.476
-Anyways, tell your mom
thanks again for that.

00:02:57.476 --> 00:02:58.711
-Oh.
-She's the best.

00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:01.047
-You know what?
I'm gonna tell her something.

00:03:01.047 --> 00:03:02.414
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.414 --> 00:03:04.717
-Let's talk
"Saturday Night Live."

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:06.152
You're on "SNL."

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.820
You're great
on "Saturday Night Live."

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:09.555
And you're good at live.

00:03:09.555 --> 00:03:11.257
Last time I saw you was
at the "Time 100" --

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:12.992
-I'm sorry. I can't think
about anything else.

00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:14.226
[ Laughter ]
I had like --

00:03:14.226 --> 00:03:15.661
-Dude, it's my favorite.

00:03:15.661 --> 00:03:17.230
We watched it in the office
like 20 times today.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:18.631
I'm like, "Oh, my God."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:20.666
"This is not real. I can't
believe we have this footage."

00:03:20.666 --> 00:03:22.635
You're like, going like,
"But this is the wrong one.

00:03:22.635 --> 00:03:23.869
I wanted the other one."

00:03:23.869 --> 00:03:25.972
You're like, "What do we do
with this banana?"

00:03:25.972 --> 00:03:27.040
And she's like,
"We'll take care of it."

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.040
You go,
"But this doesn't have a --"

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:29.609
-"But its head is gone!"
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.609 --> 00:03:31.810
-"It doesn't have a head."
Oh, my gosh.

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:33.345
It just was so cute.
It made me laugh.

00:03:33.345 --> 00:03:35.981
-Well, okay.
So, I was at a party, like,

00:03:35.981 --> 00:03:39.118
a couple months ago,
and I had like 2 1/2 mojitos.

00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:41.320
And then the next day, drunk --

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:44.257
#DrunkTaylor was like
number-one trending on Twitter.

00:03:44.257 --> 00:03:45.391
-Yeah, I saw that.

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:48.428
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:48.428 --> 00:03:51.964
-Because, you know,
I go, like, from zero

00:03:51.964 --> 00:03:55.101
to legitimately thinking I'm
a wizard within like two drinks.

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:56.435
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.435 --> 00:03:58.403
-"I'm a wizard." Yeah.
-Like, really thinking like --

00:03:58.403 --> 00:03:59.605
-You were fun, though.

00:03:59.605 --> 00:04:01.206
You were dancing around doing --
you're dancing --

00:04:01.206 --> 00:04:04.343
-Yeah, but thinking about
the fact that that

00:04:04.343 --> 00:04:07.346
went as far as it did, and then
we've got this happening...

00:04:07.346 --> 00:04:08.781
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.781 --> 00:04:10.716
-This would be -- This is Lasik.
-...that you've done this now.

00:04:10.716 --> 00:04:12.919
-This is Lasik lover.
#LasikLover.

00:04:12.919 --> 00:04:15.220
[ Laughter ]

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:17.723
#LasikLover.
Um, "SNL" --

00:04:17.723 --> 00:04:19.024
-I can't even be mad.

00:04:19.024 --> 00:04:21.294
I'm just impressed
that you infiltrated my family.

00:04:21.294 --> 00:04:22.761
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.761 --> 00:04:24.663
I don't even know
how you did that.

00:04:24.663 --> 00:04:28.568
Nobody has my mom's number.
Like, how did --

00:04:28.568 --> 00:04:30.069
-Yeah, I asked
for your mom's number.

00:04:30.069 --> 00:04:31.604
But, yeah,
we've been friends for years.

00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:33.673
-Oh, well, you know,
news to me.

00:04:33.673 --> 00:04:36.342
This is great.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:38.377
-What -- What songs
are you doing on "SNL"?

00:04:38.377 --> 00:04:39.945
Can you say?
Have you said?

00:04:39.945 --> 00:04:43.315
-Yeah, I'm fine with saying.
-You can?

00:04:43.315 --> 00:04:45.351
-I mean, I'll tell --
Well, you know, we gotta be

00:04:45.351 --> 00:04:48.454
a little cryptic,
just 'cause it's fun.

00:04:48.454 --> 00:04:51.223
But I'll probably do "Lover."
-Want to point at them?

00:04:51.223 --> 00:04:53.292
Ooh.
-I'll do "Lover," but in a way

00:04:53.292 --> 00:04:55.294
that I haven't performed it
before, which --

00:04:55.294 --> 00:04:57.730
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:00.533
And then I'm gonna do a song
that I have never performed

00:05:00.533 --> 00:05:03.902
before at all, live.
-Wow.

00:05:03.902 --> 00:05:05.203
-So...
-That's a scoop!

00:05:05.203 --> 00:05:06.872
I'll take that scoop.

00:05:06.872 --> 00:05:08.374
Taylor Swift, everybody.

